      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The mock-up doesn't mention expiry time for code. Not sure if 15 mins is right number, maybe it is.\n\nI also think that the upload screen should list the user ID\n\nI guess the other thing to handle is cross platform, doing an upload for both platforms would take more time, and I'm also wondering about updates. \n\nI hope they add this sort of feature.",
