      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: I was thinking whether or not to include the user ID and decided against it in order to have another veil of anonymity. But it goes both ways really. :)\n\nAlso, yeah the 15 minute timer was kinda added in after i did the mock up but it would be nice if like an error pops up and tells the creator that the code is expired. I was thinking of either it being a 1 time use code to upload 1 avatar or for it to be time based in case micro changes are needed within a short period of time and chose the time based limitation in this rendition.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
